<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate unit expands Bicol project.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate unit expands Bicol project.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Land Inc said on Wednesday its subsidiary Fil-Estate Properties Inc had entered into a development agreement to expand its residential project in central Bicol province.</p>
<p>Fil-Estate had acquired four parcels of land, with an aggregate area of 105,720 square metres, which are contiguous to its 59-hectare residential estate, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
